id: DK-SEC-010
ilities: [integrity]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: warn
title: Dockerfile missing USER directive (CVE-2022-0847 Dirty Pipe)
category: security
severity: warning
engine: absence
target:
  filenames: Dockerfile Dockerfile.dev Dockerfile.prod
  exclude_paths: test/ vendor/
patterns:
  - regex: ^USER\s
    message: "Dockerfile has no USER directive — container runs as root. Container escape (Dirty Pipe CVE-2022-0847) → host root."
fix: Add a non-root user. RUN adduser -D appuser && USER appuser before CMD/ENTRYPOINT.
